      "created_at": "2026-01-24T16:36:13.872Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Good day,</p>\n<p>I made an item called “Repair Service” with “Maintain Stock” unchecked. This makes it a service item.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/0/3/0317e58ee68e884edd7d253030fa1b1c18b6be8e.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/0317e58ee68e884edd7d253030fa1b1c18b6be8e\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/3/0317e58ee68e884edd7d253030fa1b1c18b6be8e_2_690x284.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"rmD76oIrcQ0u0Uo5VCa9V8Ejwy\" width=\"690\" height=\"284\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/3/0317e58ee68e884edd7d253030fa1b1c18b6be8e_2_690x284.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/3/0317e58ee68e884edd7d253030fa1b1c18b6be8e_2_1035x426.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/3/0317e58ee68e884edd7d253030fa1b1c18b6be8e_2_1380x568.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F9F9F9\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1587×655 50.4 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>I made a Purchase Order with Purchase Taxes and Charges Template</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/1/f13232ea6b9a59c352f1e27ae58b34d5eac31f6e.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/f13232ea6b9a59c352f1e27ae58b34d5eac31f6e\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/1/f13232ea6b9a59c352f1e27ae58b34d5eac31f6e_2_690x276.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"ypICv8npDrcRvFBI2BW3x15Rq34\" width=\"690\" height=\"276\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/1/f13232ea6b9a59c352f1e27ae58b34d5eac31f6e_2_690x276.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/1/f13232ea6b9a59c352f1e27ae58b34d5eac31f6e_2_1035x414.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/1/f13232ea6b9a59c352f1e27ae58b34d5eac31f6e.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAFAFA\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1311×526 27.1 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>This is my Purchase Taxes</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/a/1af4baf317d729b4c771b07610182cbcec149df2.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/1af4baf317d729b4c771b07610182cbcec149df2\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/a/1af4baf317d729b4c771b07610182cbcec149df2_2_690x292.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"3QsKheYWj0dXbhgJ0FCqQMrCau6\" width=\"690\" height=\"292\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/a/1af4baf317d729b4c771b07610182cbcec149df2_2_690x292.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/a/1af4baf317d729b4c771b07610182cbcec149df2_2_1035x438.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/a/1af4baf317d729b4c771b07610182cbcec149df2.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FBFBFB\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1315×557 27.5 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>This is the first part of the purchase tax</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/3/f/3f4e3163edf52b83078fb0037812b63ed24f9644.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/3f4e3163edf52b83078fb0037812b63ed24f9644\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/3/f/3f4e3163edf52b83078fb0037812b63ed24f9644_2_690x371.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"921BHZXDq1o26mLP3f00knxlNFa\" width=\"690\" height=\"371\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/3/f/3f4e3163edf52b83078fb0037812b63ed24f9644_2_690x371.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/3/f/3f4e3163edf52b83078fb0037812b63ed24f9644_2_1035x556.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/3/f/3f4e3163edf52b83078fb0037812b63ed24f9644.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F9F9F9\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1241×668 29.7 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>This is the second part of the purchase tax</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/3/5/35d2cb48decb732ec54de73ab7d3f3bf66858c9d.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/35d2cb48decb732ec54de73ab7d3f3bf66858c9d\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/3/5/35d2cb48decb732ec54de73ab7d3f3bf66858c9d_2_690x407.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"7G8VFzfZxKBHKxwTMynuc7K5kip\" width=\"690\" height=\"407\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/3/5/35d2cb48decb732ec54de73ab7d3f3bf66858c9d_2_690x407.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/3/5/35d2cb48decb732ec54de73ab7d3f3bf66858c9d_2_1035x610.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/3/5/35d2cb48decb732ec54de73ab7d3f3bf66858c9d.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F9F9F9\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1257×742 32.2 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>However when I save the Purchase Order, it changes the first Purchase Tax’s “Consider Tax or Charge for” into “Total” as well</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/6/d/6d9cd1de57cee34f5ae549726e2ca430f8b4b7f6.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/6d9cd1de57cee34f5ae549726e2ca430f8b4b7f6\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/d/6d9cd1de57cee34f5ae549726e2ca430f8b4b7f6_2_690x203.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"fDG1O2VN8PbeZl2IAxb5UTAU3Ai\" width=\"690\" height=\"203\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/d/6d9cd1de57cee34f5ae549726e2ca430f8b4b7f6_2_690x203.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/6/d/6d9cd1de57cee34f5ae549726e2ca430f8b4b7f6.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/6/d/6d9cd1de57cee34f5ae549726e2ca430f8b4b7f6.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"D1D1D1\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">788×232 12.2 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>My interpretation of this is that the system doesn’t allow to change the valuation of a service item, plainly because it is a service item in itself.</p>\n<p>If ever what is the best practice for cases like these?</p>",
