    {
      "id": 492518,
      "username": "asieftejani",
      "name": "Asief Tejani",
      "created_at": "2026-01-26T06:30:17.502Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Okay I understand now … thanks for reproducing it<br>\nI guess it makes logical sense that valuation can only come from the stock ledger (FIFO/AVG/LIFO) which are not maintained for services<br>\nI went into the core code and saw that it checks “Is Fixed Asset” also. I ticked it and it allowed valuation to go through<br>\nIf you have services &amp; inventory and you are not using the Assets module maybe this can help as a workaround<br>\nNot sure if it is best practise though …. we will wait for someone else to chip in</p>\n<p>Edit - not a good idea - it was debiting fixed assets accounts</p>",
